  "body": "An Exceptional Opportunity Awaits in The Bays\r\n\r\nPresenting an unmissable opportunity to secure your ultimate coastal lifestyle or embark on a lucrative development project. This immaculately presented, 1970s block and cedar residence is proudly positioned on an elevated, 809sqm freehold site, boasting spectacular, panoramic sea views towards Rangitoto, Motutapu, and Rakino Islands. On a clear day, the vistas extend to the Coromandel and Great Barrier Island, with sunsets that are simply breathtaking.\r\n\r\nThe Dream Home\r\n\r\nAs a residence, this property offers a versatile and spacious layout perfect for extended family living or accommodating teenagers. The welcoming, large entry foyer leads to a lower level featuring two double bedrooms, a generous bathroom, and a separate living area. Internal access is provided to a large tandem garage, complete with a workbench—an ideal space for the dedicated handyman.\r\n\r\nThe upper level is designed to capture the awe-inspiring scenery. The main lounge and kitchen areas are bathed in natural light and offer clear, expansive sea views that will truly inspire. Enjoy seamless indoor/outdoor flow to a large, sun-drenched deck, the perfect setting for entertaining family and friends over a summer barbecue or a glass of wine. This level also features two more double bedrooms, including the master suite with an ensuite, which overlooks the tranquil, bird-friendly garden. A spacious study offers valuable flexibility, easily serving as a work-from-home office, a second living room, or a fifth bedroom. Completing the upstairs is a dedicated laundry room leading to a private outdoor area and the established, low-maintenance back garden, which is abundant with fruit trees including peach, apricot, apple, feijoa, and guava.\r\n\r\nThe property provides a double garage, double carport, and ample off-street parking, with plenty of room for a boat or caravan.\r\n\r\nDevelopment Potential\r\n\r\nAlternatively, this commanding site holds significant potential for redevelopment. Explore the possibility of building four separate freehold properties (subject to council approval), capitalising on the desirable location and spectacular views.\r\n\r\nCoveted Coastal Location\r\n\r\nThe unbeatable location offers proximity to the vibrant Torbay village, providing easy access to a host of amenities including quality restaurants, cafes, and a supermarket. Excellent public transport links and easy motorway access ensure everything you need is within effortless reach. The property is zoned for quality schools and is moments from beautiful local beaches, reserves, and the extensive retail offering of Albany Mall.\r\n\r\nInterest in this unique property will be exceptionally high, and immediate action is advised. Call today to learn more and arrange your private viewing.",
